  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hrvatska Elektroprivreda d.d. GoGreen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A loan of up to &#x20ac;31.62 million to Hrvatska Elektroprivreda d.d. (HEP),  Croatia&apos;s national energy company to finance the construction and operation of  a solar power plant with installed capacity of up to 99 MW. The project will  benefit from 80% sovereign guarantee of the Republic of Croatia and will be a  co-financed with another bank.  The project will enable the Company to develop, construct and operate a solar  power plant with total installed capacity of up to 99 MW, supporting HEP&apos;s  decarbonisation plans.</narrative>
  </description>
